<title>INDONESIA: Bank Indonesia supplies 863 bln rph temporarily.</title>
<headline>Bank Indonesia supplies 863 bln rph temporarily.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's central bank, Bank Indonesia, supplied some 863 billion rupiah temporarily on the money market early on Monday, money traders said.</p>
<p>Some 1.031 trillion rupiah of central bank certificates (SBIs) were due today, compared with some 148 billion rupiah of maturing short-term papers (SBPUs) and 20 billion rupiah of SBIs to be settled today.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364.</p>
</text>
